project-application-unknown-project = no project { $id } is registered or has a database: nothing to repoint to
project-application-in-use = project { $id } is still the project of { $path }, which exists: pass --share if the two trees are meant to share it
project-application-not-orphan = { $id } is not an orphaned database: a live registered path, or this directory, still points at it, or it does not exist
